  id: SeaContainerPort
  displayName: Container Port
  description: 'Stacks of containers and a gantry crane over a container ship. Build
    one in two of your towns on the same water and merchant ships sail between them:
    coin and goods every voyage, more for long routes between big towns. Pirates
    prey on them; lighthouses and warships keep them safer. Each upgrade opens one
    more route.'
